.TH QUIPU-DATABOOK-EXPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-databook\-export \- Write one graph, current or as of a past point, as a DataBook
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu databook export\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-tx\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-title\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-timestamp\fR] [\fB\-\-out\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-shapes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write one graph, current or as of a past point, as a DataBook
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-tx\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-id\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-title\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-timestamp\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-out\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-with\-shapes\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
